  "project_id": 7898047,
  "title": "Kafka: Add loop checks",
  "description": "Add a check to prevent an infinite loop.\n\nMove buffer allocation out of the loop so memory use does not blow\nup and cause a potential crash and denial of service.\n\nThe reason the loop does not terminate is presumed to be bad input\nto zstd because on a cursory look the streaming decompression code\nlooks similar to the zstd documentation.\n\nFixes #18700.",
