      "id": "f8d308e9affefea9cca4bd5f2672f4c09688d4e0",
      "short_id": "f8d308e9",
      "created_at": "2022-12-05T11:53:31.000+00:00",
      "parent_ids": [
        "60cb3dd3c6161f9d5292cbda1e66344ff3a761c2"
      ],
      "title": "Kafka: Add more loop checks",
      "message": "Kafka: Add more loop checks\n\nAdd a safeguard to limit the maximum number of iterations.\n\nDo not allocate a new buffer for every loop iterations in a loop that\ndepends on the result of the decompression routine.\n\nEither allocate the buffer once or free after use. Defensive programming\nis more important than speed in this case.\n",
      "author_name": "João Valverde",
      "author_email": "j@v6e.pt",
      "authored_date": "2022-12-05T00:35:43.000+00:00",
      "committer_name": "João Valverde",
      "committer_email": "j@v6e.pt",
      "committed_date": "2022-12-05T11:53:31.000+00:00",
      "trailers": {},
      "extended_trailers": {},
      "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/commit/f8d308e9affefea9cca4bd5f2672f4c09688d4e0"
    },
    {
      "id": "60cb3dd3c6161f9d5292cbda1e66344ff3a761c2",
      "short_id": "60cb3dd3",
      "created_at": "2022-12-05T11:53:31.000+00:00",
      "parent_ids": [
        "2897e904f998ec3d11adfab5c1db33d70c941ccb"
      ],
      "title": "CMake: Remove -Wjump-misses-init warning",
      "message": "CMake: Remove -Wjump-misses-init warning\n\nIf the jump misses init it's probably because the variable is\nnot used. Don't force contortions to avoid this common and\nharmless case of \"missing init\" for an unused variable after\njumping.\n",
      "author_name": "João Valverde",
      "author_email": "j@v6e.pt",
      "authored_date": "2022-12-04T16:21:02.000+00:00",
      "committer_name": "João Valverde",
      "committer_email": "j@v6e.pt",
      "committed_date": "2022-12-05T11:53:31.000+00:00",
